      "comment": "Dex: Powers in the Temple of Space",
      "content": "Dex can drag Spacelike Vectors to move, rotate, distort and stretch objects. It seizes the cores of Segment-Domain Keepers and Maranasati Caskets to destroy them. In the Mahavaipulya Chamber and at Luyang Academy it restores folded spaces, and in the Desert Pavilion it builds and removes structures from quicksand. In the Apathic Interval it passes over the cube surface that would stop the others.",
